@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
left to right direction

state "候补中" as Wait
state "待确认" as Pending
state "已报名" as Registered
state "已签到" as Checked
state "缺席" as Absent
state "已取消" as Cancelled

[*] --> Wait : 名额不足且候补开放
[*] --> Registered : 整单报名成功

Wait -down-> Pending : 队首满足且通知成功
Pending -up-> Wait : 超时且未截止/释放预留并退队尾
Pending -right-> Registered : 期限内确认且未截止

Registered -down-> Checked : 至少一张票签到
Registered -right-> Absent : 场次结束且全未签到

Wait --> Cancelled : 取消或候补截止
Pending --> Cancelled : 放弃或候补截止
Registered --> Cancelled : 整单取消或活动取消

@enduml
